# K03 NS-ROLES-VIS (the author, 2026-10-07; semantics #declaration-visibility): an ordinary named Structure is
# visible from its place on -- only fn, fm and sub are visible both ways.  m stands above Later: Later in m is m's
# dynamic input, unbound where m is called -- refused at the call (it was a positive while -07 Q2 stood).
fn: m () int
    if: Later\v != 4U
        return: 81
    Later\v: 6U
    if: Later\v != 6U
        return: 82
    return: 7
end: m
Later:
    size_t: v 4U
end: Later
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
